 ...n-array-up-again-after-its-subscript.patch | 74 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...t-no-words-in-a-string-of-delimiters.patch | 23 ++++++
 ...l-restore-a-word-s-flags-in-any-mode.patch | 35 +++++++++
